# Python

## Stack

Python 3.13+, pydantic v2, httpx, rich. CLI uses argparse (not typer/click) — keep hook startup fast.

## Modules

| Module | Role |
|--------|------|
| `gitdiff.py` | Read staged vs HEAD blobs only |
| `manifests.py` | Parse + diff manifests |
| `scanner.py` | Gather findings; never decides |
| `heuristics.py` | Offline checks |
| `decision_engine.py` | Policy + exit code |
| `ai/client.py` | OpenAI-compatible `/chat/completions` |

## Rules

- Prefer extending existing functions over new abstractions.
- Finding text may contain attacker-controlled strings — never parse as Rich markup.
- Tests may import private helpers (`tests/*` has SLF001 ignored).
- Windows pytest: use `uv run python -m pytest` if trampoline fails.

## AI client (Qwen3 / vLLM)

- `enable_thinking: false` by default
- Read `reasoning` field when `content` is empty
- `max_output_tokens: 2048` minimum for JSON verdicts
